WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How are things going?
-Things are good.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.069 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Things feel --

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:06.439
There's a lightness to the
country right now, right?

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
-Very effervescent.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:11.945
-Yeah! There's this feel--
I think people feel heard.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:12.545 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
It feels like the nation
just feels like --

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.016 size:81% position:41% line:92%
everything feels good.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.017 line:92%
In fact, around the world.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:21.721
I think every country around
the world is feeling good.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Feels a little bit like
every country in the world

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:28.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
is in their own bathroom
with a shotgun in their mouth.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.863 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:34.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know, I was
with my friend Dennis Rodman

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.301 size:88% position:44% line:92%
recently in North Korea.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.770 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.873
And we were -- I was just
doing some advance work.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.041 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Sure, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:45.145
-But I was thinking about it,
like, really the moment that,

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, whatever
you say about Trump,

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:49.416
I do weirdly think there's
something about North Korea

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he did --
that fire and fury thing,

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:56.122 size:84% position:42%
I feel like Kim Jong-un
was like, "Oh, okay.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh.
Oh, you psycho like me, okay."

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.093 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:04.664
"Okay, you want to jerk off in a
Maserati and drive off a cliff?

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:08.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:12.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
It feels like -- I think about
like the Obama presidency,

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.274 line:92%
and it feels like a dream.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:18.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, it feels like
a long time ago.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.780
Like, it's like, when I think
about the Obama presidency,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:25.452
it feels like -- it's like
a rainy Sunday afternoon.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're at home,
you don't have anything to do.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "I'm gonna
turn on Netflix."

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"I've never seen

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.892 line:92%
'The Great British Bake Off.'"

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.162
"They're so nice to each other."
-Yeah.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.432 size:88% position:44%
-"This is so pleasant."
You kind of fall asleep.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
You wake up.
You got a [bleep] on.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.470 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You're like, "This is --

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I'm gonna have sex
with a Swiss roll."

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"This is terrific."

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.543
But that is the thing with Obama
that people won't admit

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:54.180
is that, like, he kind of --
he kind of put me to sleep.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-Like, there was --

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:58.818
And I can tell by the audience
laughter and applause to that

00:01:58.818 --> 00:01:59.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
that they agree.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he really -- like,
there was something about him

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:05.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
that, like --
like, you'd start a debate.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:07.160
You'd be like, "All right,
Barack, what do we got?"

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.028 size:81% position:41%
And then he'd be like,
"Well..." and then...

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
...you'd kind of be like...

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.967 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.568 line:92%
"I know I agree with him.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gonna pass out
for a little while."

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:20.373 size:88% position:44%
I don't think I'll think
of the Trump presidency

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the same way.
-Yeah.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:24.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like a nice, rainy
Sunday afternoon.

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think the Trump presidency
will be like

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:29.315
it's 3:00 in the morning
and a fire alarm goes off,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:32.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it just starts
raining in your room.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:34.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you go outside,
and it's daylight.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:37.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's, like,
a bunch of lifeguards, like,

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.224 size:75% position:38% line:92%
beating up a gerbil.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"What's happening?"

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.061 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.530
I think that's how I'll remember
this presidency.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.532
-Yeah, that's a pretty good way
to remember it.

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I will say that
a nice escape

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:49.602
from everything going on
in this world is this film.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:52.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a very funny film,
"Uncle Drew."

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's also a very sweet film.
-Yes.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a nice film
about a family.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:57.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes. Yeah.

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You play, by far,
the worst person in the movie.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:00.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Yes, I do.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:06.219
-But the other people --
You know, this is Kyrie Irving.

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:08.788 size:81% position:41%
This is Nate Robinson,
Reggie Miller, Shaq,

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.023 line:92%
Chris Webber, Lisa Leslie.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, they're all --
these are basketball players

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are very, very funny.
-Legends.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And they are -- they are --

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is crazy, 'cause I decided,
I was like,

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, I'd love to do
this movie.

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:19.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
It'll be fun.
I'll be funny.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe I'll play
some basketball with them."

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:24.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
It turns out that
they are so much funnier

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:28.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
